# The unstamped conjunct of Armed dropped: an activation arms without reading past
# the unstamped appends its own appends reported, and its live advance passes a
# 10.2.0 silo's acknowledged write. Moved from the design's mutation of the same
# name. It edits the Armed predicate, so it names no perturbed action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestUnstampedNotReported
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the activation arms without reading past the highest reported unstamped append

--- FIND
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
--- REPLACE
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
\* MUTATION: reported unstamped appends are not waited for.
--- END
